Package: zeerak
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nftables, adduser
Recommends: caddy
Description: lightweight web GUI firewall for nftables
Zeerak is a single-binary, server-rendered web GUI for managing nftables.
It bundles a daemon (zeerak-server), a CLI (zeerak), and an MCP server
(zeerak-mcp) for AI assistants. Every change goes through a stage,
preview, and confirm-or-auto-rollback flow so you can't lock yourself out.
